OL,3,GNEWSASydney Sweeney wing-walks on plane
OL,4,Aabove Ashford
OL,5,
OL,6,FMichael Pickin, director and pilot at
OL,7,FHeadcorn-based The Wing Walk Company,
OL,8,Fdescribed Sweeney as having been "a bit
OL,9,Fapprehensive at first", but,
OL,10,Fultimately, "an adrenaline junkie at
OL,11,Fheart".
